{"method": "item/commandExecution/outputDelta", "params": {"threadId": "01a1aa10-a36f-7451-9cdf-d33e3bb037e2", "turnId": "01a1aa16-5664-7b60-ac83-c4dec9c57fb5", "itemId": "exec-821a220e-f350-4c27-8a59-04421998abac", "delta": "\r\n"}, "emittedAtMs": 1793855122754}
{"method": "item/commandExecution/outputDelta", "params": {"threadId": "01a1aa10-a36f-7451-9cdf-d33e3bb037e2", "turnId": "01a1aa16-5664-7b60-ac83-c4dec9c57fb5", "itemId": "exec-821a220e-f350-4c27-8a59-04421998abac", "delta": "- By default, `get_window_state({ window })` captures and automatically displays a screenshot, and returns `accessibility: null`. This is the best default for desktop apps with weak accessibility trees."}, "emittedAtMs": 1793855122754}
