{"method": "item/commandExecution/outputDelta", "params": {"threadId": "01a1aa10-a36f-7451-9cdf-d33e3bb037e2", "turnId": "01a1aa16-5664-7b60-ac83-c4dec9c57fb5", "itemId": "exec-821a220e-f350-4c27-8a59-04421998abac", "delta": "- If you need accessibility text or element indexes, call `get_window_state({ window, include_screenshot: false, include_text: true })`. Request both only when you truly need both the screenshot and accessibility text for the next decision."}, "emittedAtMs": 1793855122754}
{"method": "item/commandExecution/outputDelta", "params": {"threadId": "01a1aa10-a36f-7451-9cdf-d33e3bb037e2", "turnId": "01a1aa16-5664-7b60-ac83-c4dec9c57fb5", "itemId": "exec-821a220e-f350-4c27-8a59-04421998abac", "delta": "\r\n"}, "emittedAtMs": 1793855122754}
{"method": "item/commandExecution/outputDelta", "params": {"threadId": "01a1aa10-a36f-7451-9cdf-d33e3bb037e2", "turnId": "01a1aa16-5664-7b60-ac83-c4dec9c57fb5", "itemId": "exec-821a220e-f350-4c27-8a59-04421998abac", "delta": "- Important accessibility context is also extracted as structured fields: `focused_element`, `selected_text`, `selected_elements`, and `document_text`."}, "emittedAtMs": 1793855122754}
{"method": "item/commandExecution/outputDelta", "params": {"threadId": "01a1aa10-a36f-7451-9cdf-d33e3bb037e2", "turnId": "01a1aa16-5664-7b60-ac83-c4dec9c57fb5", "itemId": "exec-821a220e-f350-4c27-8a59-04421998abac", "delta": "\r\n"}, "emittedAtMs": 1793855122754}
{"method": "item/commandExecution/outputDelta", "params": {"threadId": "01a1aa10-a36f-7451-9cdf-d33e3bb037e2", "turnId": "01a1aa16-5664-7b60-ac83-c4dec9c57fb5", "itemId": "exec-821a220e-f350-4c27-8a59-04421998abac", "delta": "- If an input call reports that the point is over a non-target window, call `sky.activate_window({ window: state.window })`, refresh screenshot-backed state, and retry the intended input once with the refreshed `state.window`."}, "emittedAtMs": 1793855122754}
{"method": "item/commandExecution/outputDelta", "params": {"threadId": "01a1aa10-a36f-7451-9cdf-d33e3bb037e2", "turnId": "01a1aa16-5664-7b60-ac83-c4dec9c57fb5", "itemId": "exec-821a220e-f350-4c27-8a59-04421998abac", "delta": "\r\n"}, "emittedAtMs": 1793855122754}
{"method": "item/commandExecution/outputDelta", "params": {"threadId": "01a1aa10-a36f-7451-9cdf-d33e3bb037e2", "turnId": "01a1aa16-5664-7b60-ac83-c4dec9c57fb5", "itemId": "exec-821a220e-f350-4c27-8a59-04421998abac", "delta": "- If you expect a modal in the target app but `get_window_state` does not show it, call `sky.list_windows()` to find the modal or owned secondary window, then capture that returned window with `sky.get_window_state(...)`."}, "emittedAtMs": 1793855122754}
{"method": "item/commandExecution/outputDelta", "params": {"threadId": "01a1aa10-a36f-7451-9cdf-d33e3bb037e2", "turnId": "01a1aa16-5664-7b60-ac83-c4dec9c57fb5", "itemId": "exec-821a220e-f350-4c27-8a59-04421998abac", "delta": "\r\n"}, "emittedAtMs": 1793855122754}
{"method": "item/commandExecution/outputDelta", "params": {"threadId": "01a1aa10-a36f-7451-9cdf-d33e3bb037e2", "turnId": "01a1aa16-5664-7b60-ac83-c4dec9c57fb5", "itemId": "exec-821a220e-f350-4c27-8a59-04421998abac", "delta": "- `type_text` sends literal text. Re-check focus immediately before `type_text`; use `press_key` for controls such as `Enter`, `Tab`, arrows, Escape, and keyboard chords instead of embedding control characters in a typed string."}, "emittedAtMs": 1793855122754}
{"method": "item/commandExecution/outputDelta", "params": {"threadId": "01a1aa10-a36f-7451-9cdf-d33e3bb037e2", "turnId": "01a1aa16-5664-7b60-ac83-c4dec9c57fb5", "itemId": "exec-821a220e-f350-4c27-8a59-04421998abac", "delta": "\r\n"}, "emittedAtMs": 1793855122754}
{"method": "item/commandExecution/outputDelta", "params": {"threadId": "01a1aa10-a36f-7451-9cdf-d33e3bb037e2", "turnId": "01a1aa16-5664-7b60-ac83-c4dec9c57fb5", "itemId": "exec-821a220e-f350-4c27-8a59-04421998abac", "delta": "- Prefer X Window System keysym-style names for key input, especially `KP_0` through `KP_9` for apps that distinguish numpad keys from the number row. Common aliases such as `period`, `greater`, `less`, `comma`, `slash`, `question`, `Numpad_0`, `Numpad_Add"}, "emittedAtMs": 1793855122755}
{"method": "item/commandExecution/outputDelta", "params": {"threadId": "01a1aa10-a36f-7451-9cdf-d33e3bb037e2", "turnId": "01a1aa16-5664-7b60-ac83-c4dec9c57fb5", "itemId": "exec-821a220e-f350-4c27-8a59-04421998abac", "delta": "`, `Numpad_Subtract`, `Numpad_Multiply`, `Numpad_Divide`, `Numpad_Decimal`, and `Numpad_Enter` are also supported. For shifted punctuation shortcuts, include `Shift`, for example `Control_L+Shift_L+period` for Ctrl+Shift+`.` / `>`.\r\n"}, "emittedAtMs": 1793855122755}
{"method": "item/commandExecution/outputDelta", "params": {"threadId": "01a1aa10-a36f-7451-9cdf-d33e3bb037e2", "turnId": "01a1aa16-5664-7b60-ac83-c4dec9c57fb5", "itemId": "exec-821a220e-f350-4c27-8a59-04421998abac", "delta": "- `scroll` scrolls with input injection from a specific window-relative coordinate. Use `sky.scroll({ window, x, y, scrollX: 0, scrollY: 600 })` to scroll down from `(x, y)`. Negative `scrollY` scrolls up; negative `scrollX` scrolls left. Do not pass `elem"}, "emittedAtMs": 1793855122755}
{"method": "item/commandExecution/outputDelta", "params": {"threadId": "01a1aa10-a36f-7451-9cdf-d33e3bb037e2", "turnId": "01a1aa16-5664-7b60-ac83-c4dec9c57fb5", "itemId": "exec-821a220e-f350-4c27-8a59-04421998abac", "delta": "ent_index` to `scroll`; if a specific pane needs focus, click it first with coordinates, then scroll from inside that pane.\r\n"}, "emittedAtMs": 1793855122755}
{"method": "item/commandExecution/outputDelta", "params": {"threadId": "01a1aa10-a36f-7451-9cdf-d33e3bb037e2", "turnId": "01a1aa16-5664-7b60-ac83-c4dec9c57fb5", "itemId": "exec-821a220e-f350-4c27-8a59-04421998abac", "delta": "- Use keyboard navigation when it is faster than hunting UI pixels."}, "emittedAtMs": 1793855122755}
{"method": "item/commandExecution/outputDelta", "params": {"threadId": "01a1aa10-a36f-7451-9cdf-d33e3bb037e2", "turnId": "01a1aa16-5664-7b60-ac83-c4dec9c57fb5", "itemId": "exec-821a220e-f350-4c27-8a59-04421998abac", "delta": "\r\n"}, "emittedAtMs": 1793855122755}
{"method": "item/commandExecution/outputDelta", "params": {"threadId": "01a1aa10-a36f-7451-9cdf-d33e3bb037e2", "turnId": "01a1aa16-5664-7b60-ac83-c4dec9c57fb5", "itemId": "exec-821a220e-f350-4c27-8a59-04421998abac", "delta": "- For text entry into a document, slide, sheet, editor, or canvas, foreground process metadata and window title are not enough. Click a stable point or element inside the observed editable work surface, refresh to verify focus, then type. If the requested "}, "emittedAtMs": 1793855122755}
{"method": "item/commandExecution/outputDelta", "params": {"threadId": "01a1aa10-a36f-7451-9cdf-d33e3bb037e2", "turnId": "01a1aa16-5664-7b60-ac83-c4dec9c57fb5", "itemId": "exec-821a220e-f350-4c27-8a59-04421998abac", "delta": "text is not visible after a refresh, refocus the editable surface and retry.\r\n"}, "emittedAtMs": 1793855122755}
