{"method": "item/commandExecution/outputDelta", "params": {"threadId": "01a1aa10-a36f-7451-9cdf-d33e3bb037e2", "turnId": "01a1aa16-5664-7b60-ac83-c4dec9c57fb5", "itemId": "exec-821a220e-f350-4c27-8a59-04421998abac", "delta": "- If `list_apps`, `list_windows`, or another lightweight call times out, wait 2 seconds and retry the same lightweight call once. If it times out again, reset the JavaScript session if available, rerun Initialize, retry once, then stop and report that the "}, "emittedAtMs": 1793855122756}
{"method": "item/commandExecution/outputDelta", "params": {"threadId": "01a1aa10-a36f-7451-9cdf-d33e3bb037e2", "turnId": "01a1aa16-5664-7b60-ac83-c4dec9c57fb5", "itemId": "exec-821a220e-f350-4c27-8a59-04421998abac", "delta": "Windows Computer Use helper may have failed.\r\n"}, "emittedAtMs": 1793855122756}
{"method": "item/commandExecution/outputDelta", "params": {"threadId": "01a1aa10-a36f-7451-9cdf-d33e3bb037e2", "turnId": "01a1aa16-5664-7b60-ac83-c4dec9c57fb5", "itemId": "exec-821a220e-f350-4c27-8a59-04421998abac", "delta": "- If state capture or window activation fails, stop using prior coordinates or element indexes. Refresh the app/window selection and retry once; report the exact error if recovery fails."}, "emittedAtMs": 1793855122756}
{"method": "item/commandExecution/outputDelta", "params": {"threadId": "01a1aa10-a36f-7451-9cdf-d33e3bb037e2", "turnId": "01a1aa16-5664-7b60-ac83-c4dec9c57fb5", "itemId": "exec-821a220e-f350-4c27-8a59-04421998abac", "delta": "\r\n"}, "emittedAtMs": 1793855122756}
